WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.384 --> 00:00:04.966
The question of whether
this is legally binding,

2
00:00:04.966 --> 00:00:08.187
or whether such a rulework
is legally binding.

3
00:00:08.187 --> 00:00:10.928
The law is legally binding.

4
00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:15.770
These are machine-executable
interpretations of the law.

5
00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:20.372
Just as software today is a
machine-executable interpretation.

6
00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:23.153
The machine-executable
version is not the law itself.

7
00:00:23.153 --> 00:00:25.154
The law is the law.

8
00:00:25.154 --> 00:00:29.115
This is merely a machine-executable
interpretation of it.

9
00:00:29.115 --> 00:00:33.419
It also has only that status,

10
00:00:33.419 --> 00:00:35.461
and is therefore open to challenge.

11
00:00:35.461 --> 00:00:40.385
The big difference: this
interpretation can be inspected

12
00:00:40.385 --> 00:00:46.223
by the implementer, citizen,

13
00:00:46.223 --> 00:00:52.048
business, legislator and judge.

14
00:00:52.048 --> 00:00:52.788
They can all look along.

15
00:00:52.788 --> 00:00:56.579
The interpretation is
transparent and published.
